  "format": "kshader",
  "generator": "Kekenik Shader",
  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_inputs",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 762
        },
        "text": "**Age** = *Age Percent* (TEXCOORD1.x) and **Random** = *Stable Random* (TEXCOORD1.y) of the Unity particle system, colour = vertex colour. V is the length axis of the comet (head at V = 1), U the width."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_shape",
        "position": {
          "x": 988,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2378
        },
        "text": "Half-width profile `0.12 + 0.88·v^1.4` scaled by *Tail Width*: narrow at the tail, full at the head. `across = |u − ½|·2`; mask = `1 − smoothstep(0.6·p, p, across)`. The head end is cut softly with `1 − smoothstep(0.9, 1, v)`."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_noise",
        "position": {
          "x": 988,
          "y": 749
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2072
        },
        "text": "`uv' = (u·tileX + random, v·tileY − age·scroll)`: the random number offsets the pattern per particle so no two sparks match, and the pattern slides down the tail as the particle ages. One texture fetch."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_dissolve",
        "position": {
          "x": 3570,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 73,
          "w": 848
        },
        "text": "`noise' = lerp(noise, v, tailBias)` — the head (v = 1) keeps the highest values and survives longest. `amount = age^curve` drives the shared **Soft Edge Dissolve** subgraph, which returns the alpha mask and the glowing band just inside the cut."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fbbf24",
        "id": "note_color",
        "position": {
          "x": 4622,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1460
        },
        "text": "`body = lerp(tail, head, v)`; `colour = (body + edgeColor × edge × intensity) × particle colour`; alpha = shape × dissolve alpha × particle alpha."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 6286,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Additive blend, ZWrite off, two-sided."
      }
    ],
